    "deleteBlocks" ["Delete several blocks" "Deletes up to 100 blocks, with their descendants, in one transaction: if any UUID is missing or names a page, tag or property, nothing is deleted. dry-run reports the counts without deleting, and gives each named block its references: how many blocks and pages the delete leaves would lose a link, embed or property value pointing into it or a block under it. Each named block's page, breadcrumb, snippet and descendant count are under affected, read before the delete; any block still there afterwards answers 500, naming it in the error and under not-removed."]
+   "deleteBlankBlocks" ["Delete blank blocks on pages"
