+                             " page-ids are page UUIDs, titles or YYYY-MM-DD journal dates; journals are allowed, today's included. The whole call is refused, naming page-ids[i] and writing nothing, when a page isn't found (a hidden page or one in the Recycle bin reads as not found; 404), a title names several pages (409, with candidates), two entries name the same page, or a page is a whiteboard, a tag, a property, not a page, or Private (400). E2EE graphs are refused with 409: a blank title can't be told from ciphertext."
