+(defn- expected-outlines
+  "Example and Projects of two-pages! once their blank leaves are gone."
+  [{:keys [e1 e3 e5 e6 e8 p1 p3]}]
+  [{:page [e1 e3 e5] e5 [e6 e8]} {:page [p1 p3]}])
