+(deftest apply-accepts-test
+  ;; Inputs next to a refusal that must still delete: an id in upper case (the dry run lists lower
+  ;; case), dry-run false given explicitly, a page listed with no id on it, and a blank leaf whose
+  ;; sibling and parent changed after the dry run.
