+(deftest confirm-removed-read-back-test
+  ;; STUBS A STEP (labelled): delete-blocks! is redefined to leave the last block it is given, so the
+  ;; read-back (confirm-removed!) has a survivor to find. The call answers 500 naming it.
+  (async done
